VOIDUP 0.1 engineering — private 2-of-3 test trust roots

Global options (before command):
  --root ABSOLUTE-PATH  Dedicated per-user root
  --catalog HTTPS-URL   Explicit private catalog endpoint
  --ca-file PEM         Explicit replacement TLS roots
  --timeout-ms N        100..120000, default 30000

Commands:
  --help | --version
  list [--available]
  install RELEASE [--activate]
  default RELEASE
  rollback
  which <voidc|voidls>
  verify RELEASE
  doctor
  run <RELEASE|default> <voidc|voidls> -- <literal arguments...>

Published versions are retained. No pruning, self-update, PATH or shell changes.
